msgstr "Ką jis tikrina"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:13
msgid "If it fails"
msgstr "Jei nepavyksta"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "**mesh**"
msgstr "**mesh**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're on the fabric's network"
msgstr "Esate fabric tinkle"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:15
msgid "You're off-mesh — bring up your tunnel (`netbird status` / re-enroll)"
msgstr ""
"Esate ne mesh — pakelkite savo tunelį (`netbird status` / užsiregistruokite "
"iš naujo)"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "**router**"
msgstr "**router**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid "The fabric's router is reachable"
msgstr "fabric router yra pasiekiamas"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:16
msgid ""
"The router may be down, or your endpoint is wrong — re-check your profile"
msgstr ""
"router gali būti nepasiekiamas arba jūsų galinis taškas neteisingas — "
"patikrinkite savo profilį iš naujo"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "**certificate**"
msgstr "**certificate**"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid "Your identity is accepted"
msgstr "Jūsų tapatybė priimta"

#: src/troubleshooting.md:17
msgid ""
"Your cert may be expired or rejected — `goat profile show`, then re-onboard "
